  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nOn purchase, recruit up to 2
    Balloon Mallets, within the 15-body limit.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3
    traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN
    THE WAITING REALM\nA railway repairer who made locks until learning where officials
    installed them. They kept a duplicate master key. They want to teach repairs
    that give residents control of their own doors.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional
    periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or
    special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: hearth, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
